      "writtenOn": "2018-01-26T23:35:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do you need this cpufreq_states data struct if all it\u0027s doing is keeping a frequency table list that matches the frequency in the cpufreq\u0027s freq table? Why not just directly access it after accounting for times-\u003eoffset instead of creating and maintaining this new struct?",
      "revId": "820d41cb89de80e1093c73e23eae991006cbc046",
